---
// FeatureBento: 6 Core Engineering Superpowers of 10xGraph
---

<section class="bento-section" id="features">
  <div class="bento-container">
    <div class="bento-header">
      <span class="bento-tag">ENGINEERING FOUNDATIONS</span>
      <h2 class="bento-title">Built for Systems That Cannot Afford to Hallucinate or Crash</h2>
      <p class="bento-desc">
        Every design decision in 10xGraph prioritizes determinism, state recovery, and production isolation over toy demo scripts.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-grid">
      <!-- Tile 1: Durable Replay & Ledger (Large) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-col-2">
        <div class="card-visual">
          <div class="ledger-sim">
            <div class="ledger-row executed">
              <span class="ledger-icon">✓</span>
              <span class="ledger-text">execute_payment(card="*4242", amount=$85)</span>
              <span class="ledger-status">COMMITTED</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger-crash-line">
              <span class="crash-badge">⚡ WORKER CRASH (Process Killed)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ledger-row resume">
              <span class="ledger-icon text-signal">↻</span>
              <span class="ledger-text">Resume execution from checkpoint 0x4e2</span>
              <span class="ledger-status status-skip">SKIPPED (No Double Charge)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="feature-tag">DURABLE CHECKPOINTING</span>
          <h3 class="card-title">Replay-Safe Tool Execution</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            If an agent crashes mid-routine, 10xGraph resumes from the exact state snapshot. A tool call recorded in the ledger is never executed twice.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tile 2: Two-Tier Memory -->
      <div class="bento-card">
        <div class="card-visual">
          <div class="memory-stack">
            <div class="memory-tier hot">
              <span class="tier-label">HOT CACHE (Redis)</span>
              <span class="tier-speed">&lt; 1.2ms latency</span>
              <span class="tier-sub">Active thread state &amp; checkpoints</span>
            </div>
            <div class="memory-tier cold">
              <span class="tier-label">COLD ARCHIVE (Postgres)</span>
              <span class="tier-speed">Full telemetry</span>
              <span class="tier-sub">Auditable history &amp; tool traces</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="feature-tag">HYBRID MEMORY</span>
          <h3 class="card-title">Two-Tier State Storage</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Sub-millisecond prompt context from Redis hot memory paired with PostgreSQL for immutable long-term compliance audits.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tile 3: Per-Tool RBAC -->
      <div class="bento-card">
        <div class="card-visual">
          <div class="rbac-matrix">
            <div class="rbac-row header">
              <span>Tool</span>
              <span>Agent</span>
              <span>Admin</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rbac-row">
              <span class="tool-name">db_query</span>
              <span class="check-green">✓</span>
              <span class="check-green">✓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rbac-row">
              <span class="tool-name">refund_charge</span>
              <span class="cross-red">✕</span>
              <span class="check-green">✓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rbac-row">
              <span class="tool-name">deploy_prod</span>
              <span class="cross-red">✕</span>
              <span class="check-green">✓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="feature-tag">SECURITY &amp; ACCESS</span>
          <h3 class="card-title">Per-Tool RBAC &amp; Rate Limits</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Annotate sensitive tools with granular permission scopes. Guardrails reject unprivileged tool invocations before the LLM ever executes them.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tile 4: Streaming Telemetry -->
      <div class="bento-card">
        <div class="card-visual">
          <div class="stream-box">
            <div class="stream-header">
              <span class="stream-pulse"></span>
              <span>SSE STREAM (text/event-stream)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stream-chunks">
              <span class="chunk">event: node_start</span>
              <span class="chunk">data: &#123;"node": "verifier"&#125;</span>
              <span class="chunk highlight">token: "Calculating"</span>
              <span class="chunk highlight">token: " optimal"</span>
              <span class="chunk highlight">token: " route..."</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="feature-tag">TELEMETRY</span>
          <h3 class="card-title">Real-Time Event Streaming</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Stream tokens, tool inputs, and node lifecycle events over Server-Sent Events (SSE) and WebSockets with zero client buffering.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tile 5: Multi-Agent Handoffs -->
      <div class="bento-card">
        <div class="card-visual">
          <div class="swarm-visual">
            <div class="swarm-node core">Orchestrator</div>
            <div class="swarm-branches">
              <div class="swarm-node sub">Coder</div>
              <div class="swarm-node sub">Tester</div>
              <div class="swarm-node sub">Auditor</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="feature-tag">MULTI-AGENT SWARMS</span>
          <h3 class="card-title">Deterministic Agent Handoffs</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Coordinate autonomous agent clusters with typed state contracts. Dynamic routing without cascading prompt degradation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bento-section {
    padding: 7rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .bento-container {
    max-width: 1240px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .bento-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto 4.5rem;
  }
  .bento-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--signal);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .bento-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .bento-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .bento-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .bento-col-2 {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1080px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
    .bento-col-2 {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
  }

  .bento-card {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .bento-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(200, 255, 61, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .card-visual {
    padding: 2rem;
    min-height: 180px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .card-content {
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }
  .feature-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--signal);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .card-desc {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Sim 1: Ledger */
  .ledger-sim {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }
  .ledger-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ledger-icon { font-weight: bold; margin-right: 0.5rem; color: #27c93f; }
  .text-signal { color: var(--signal) !important; }
  .ledger-status {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(39, 201, 63, 0.15);
    color: #27c93f;
  }
  .status-skip {
    background: rgba(200, 255, 61, 0.15);
    color: var(--signal);
  }
  .ledger-crash-line {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.25rem 0;
  }
  .crash-badge {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--danger);
    background: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.1);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.2);
  }

  /* Sim 2: Memory */
  .memory-stack {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .memory-tier {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .memory-tier.hot {
    background: rgba(94, 230, 240, 0.05);
    border-color: rgba(94, 230, 240, 0.3);
  }
  .memory-tier.cold {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }
  .tier-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--data-edge);
  }
  .tier-speed {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .tier-sub {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Sim 3: RBAC */
  .rbac-matrix {
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .rbac-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .rbac-row.header {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .check-green { color: #27c93f; font-weight: bold; }
  .cross-red { color: var(--danger); font-weight: bold; }

  /* Sim 4: Stream */
  .stream-box {
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }
  .stream-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--signal);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .stream-pulse {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--signal);
    animation: stream-blink 1s infinite alternate;
  }
  @keyframes stream-blink { from { opacity: 0.2; } to { opacity: 1; } }
  .stream-chunks {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .chunk.highlight { color: #5ee6f0; }

  /* Sim 5: Swarm */
  .swarm-visual {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }
  .swarm-node {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }
  .swarm-node.core {
    background: var(--signal);
    color: var(--signal-text);
  }
  .swarm-branches {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .swarm-node.sub {
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
